uecity.com/news/2026/10/25/126815766.html?v=1792980030</guid><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 02:00:46 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>指纹揭密：兵马俑制作者3成是女性 2成未成年…</title><link>https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/10/25/126815774.html?v=1792980030</link><description>&lt;div style="margin-bottom: 15px;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://www.wenxuecity.com/data/news/202610/25/8eedbb8956d276f7358e1b57ca125851.webp" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px; display: block;" /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="font-size: 14px; color: #444; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;"&gt;秦始皇兵马俑的制作者，竟有3成是女性、有2成是未成年人，而且无论男女制作者都很年轻。这是秦始皇帝陵博物馆与山东大学考古学院合作，从兵马俑上79枚指纹，得出的最新研究成果。兵马俑。《陕视新闻》据《陕视新闻》报导，秦始皇帝陵博物馆与山东大学合作，研究兵马俑制作者年龄与性别构成，成果近日发表于《文化遗产杂志》期刊。研究团队从秦皇陵一号坑的23件陶俑上取得79枚独立指纹样本，使用指纹贝叶斯混合模型研究方法...&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/10/25/126815774.html?v=1792980030</guid><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 02:00:44 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>微博热搜：“高市早苗点名要看抹黑中国日剧”</title><link>https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/10/25/126815780.html?v=1792980030</link><description>&lt;div style="margin-bottom: 15px;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://www.wenxuecity.com/data/news/202610/25/170b27e29694e657878bb75d35e2f737.webp" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px; display: block;" /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="font-size: 14px; color: #444; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;"&gt;WENXUECITY.COM does not represent or guarantee the truthfulness, accuracy, or reliability of any of communications posted by other users. Copyright ©1998-2026wenxuecity.comAll rights reserved.Privacy ...&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/10/25/126815780.html?v=1792980030</guid><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 02:00:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>大锤砸掉硫磺岛纪念雕像头颅 美27岁男子被捕</title><link>https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/10/25/126815794.html?v=1792980030</link><description>&lt;div style="margin-bottom: 15px;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://www.wenxuecity.c